    "AggregateRating": "Intentionally absent from every schema-output.json in this repo — not a gap, not unimplemented. jvto-web renders the live AggregateRating node itself, reading directly from 1-knowledge-and-evidence-core/credentials-and-public-evidence/review-platforms.json (jvto-web: src/lib/publicContent/getAggregateRating.ts, src/lib/ecosystemContent/reviewPlatforms.ts). That file is the single source of truth for the rating (owner decision 2026-08-15/2026-08-19); this repo's json-ld build output is a different artifact and was never that source's transport. See scripts/render-web-content-sources.mjs for the full rationale. Do not add AggregateRating here to 'fix' this.",
    "Review": "Also intentionally absent, same reasoning as AggregateRating. jvto-web already renders per-review Review nodes live (buildIndividualReviewSchemas() in src/lib/schemas/buildWhyJvtoSchemas.ts, used on /why-jvto/reviews and /why-jvto/[slug]) reading directly from this repo's 1-knowledge-and-evidence-core/credentials-and-public-evidence/reviews.json — shipped as Phase 2 of the Google Reviews migration, completed 2026-08-19. reviews.json is appended to daily by sync-google-reviews.yml (nextId grows over time), so a static snapshot in this folder's build output would drift/lag the same way a static AggregateRating would. Do not add Review nodes here to 'fix' this.",
    "TouristTrip_and_Offer": "REVERSED 2026-08-20 (was: intentionally absent). Design spec 2026-08-20-ekosistem-schema-rendering-consolidation-design.md Bagian 3 moved TouristTrip/Offer assembly into ekosistem for the 17 tour-product PDP routes — see schemaByType.TouristTrip and scripts/generate-tourist-trip-schema.mjs. The AggregateRating/Review omissions recorded elsewhere in this object are UNRELATED and still stand (separate Bagian 1/2 of the same spec, not touched by this generator)."
